---
layout: 'modules/common-styling/style-guide'
---
<div class="styleguide-ds">

  <div class="styleguide-ds-layout">

    <aside class="styleguide-ds-sidebar">
      {% render 'modules/common-styling/style-guide/nav-left', active: '/style-guide/component-anatomy' %}
    </aside>

    <main class="styleguide-ds-main" id="main-content">
      <article class="styleguide-ds-article">

        <header class="styleguide-ds-article-header">
          <h1 class="pos-heading-1">Component anatomy</h1>
          <p>Every component in this design system is built from four independent layers. Each layer has its own source of truth in Figma and its own mechanism in code — no layer does the job of another.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="anatomy-grid">

          <div class="pos-feature-card anatomy-layer-card">
            <div class="pos-feature-card-icon">
              {% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'color-palette-sample' %}
            </div>
            <div class="pos-feature-card-body">
              <h3 class="pos-feature-card-title"><span>Appearance</span></h3>
              <p class="pos-feature-card-lead">Color, typography, border, shadow.</p>
              <div class="anatomy-flow">
                <span>Figma variable</span>
                <span class="anatomy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'dashRight' %}</span>
                <code class="pos-code pos-code--small">semantic CSS token</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pos-feature-card anatomy-layer-card">
            <div class="pos-feature-card-icon">
              {% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'expand-horizontal-4' %}
            </div>
            <div class="pos-feature-card-body">
              <h3 class="pos-feature-card-title"><span>Layout</span></h3>
              <p class="pos-feature-card-lead">Size, padding, gap, radius.</p>
              <div class="anatomy-flow">
                <span>Figma measurement</span>
                <span class="anatomy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'dashRight' %}</span>
                <code class="pos-code pos-code--small">spacing / size token</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pos-feature-card anatomy-layer-card">
            <div class="pos-feature-card-icon">
              {% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'cursor-select-4' %}
            </div>
            <div class="pos-feature-card-body">
              <h3 class="pos-feature-card-title"><span>Interactions</span></h3>
              <p class="pos-feature-card-lead">Hover, focus, drag, expand.</p>
              <div class="anatomy-flow">
                <code class="pos-code pos-code--small">pos-anim-*</code>
                <span class="anatomy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'dashRight' %}</span>
                <code class="pos-code pos-code--small">window.pos.behaviors.*</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pos-feature-card anatomy-layer-card">
            <div class="pos-feature-card-icon">
              {% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'sign-badge-circle' %}
            </div>
            <div class="pos-feature-card-body">
              <h3 class="pos-feature-card-title"><span>States</span></h3>
              <p class="pos-feature-card-lead">Default, hover, disabled, error.</p>
              <div class="anatomy-flow">
                <span>Figma variant</span>
                <span class="anatomy-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'modules/common-styling/icon', icon: 'dashRight' %}</span>
                <code class="pos-code pos-code--small">modifier class / pseudo-class / data-attribute</code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </section>

      </article>
    </main>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .anatomy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--pos-primitive-size-2);
  }

  .anatomy-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--pos-primitive-size-05);
    color: var(--pos-color-content-text-supplementary);
    font-size: var(--pos-font-size-ss);
  }

  .anatomy-flow-arrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--pos-color-content-text-supplementary);
  }

  .anatomy-flow-arrow .pos-icon {
    width: var(--pos-size-icon-xs);
    height: var(--pos-size-icon-xs);
  }

  /* these cards are static (plain <div>, no click target) — reset the hover-interactive
     look pos-feature-card normally has (lift shadow, title color + underline reveal),
     since nothing here leads anywhere */
  .anatomy-layer-card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--pos-primitive-shadow-medium);
  }

  .anatomy-layer-card:hover .pos-feature-card-title {
    color: var(--pos-color-content-text-prominent);
  }

  .anatomy-layer-card:hover .pos-feature-card-title > span {
    background-size: 0% 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .anatomy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
